=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQq8gZurBhA2CjdWvt1JZQKmLPj_UfPdt2FAwp586kdkQ&oe=6AFDD472"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1334999902070550", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_1334999905403883_7825560239183096548_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PrTWUQJjXRIQ7kNvwETIkri&_nc_oc=AdrDpgR-3ziX0LID57m7ESh2ZeRO-Hw4N7G7I6c9VZLmLfRJE1lmVoabjzgYgHlFTaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHDX_gaGtLrzIHCFrMUa_Iq0Q5_EnW1S6NEiyXr280gA&oe=6AFDB2AB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The Bridge To One", "keywords": ["future", "climate", "education", "storytelling", "experience"], "long_description": "Bridge To One is an immersive XR narrative experience that places you in the space between possible futures. In this 12-minute journey, you witness three paths humanity could take in the age of advanced AI: escalating conflict, deep social division, or a cooperative abundant future rooted in shared intelligence, restored nature, and global alignment.\n\nThrough symbolic interaction, emotional storytelling, spatial audio, and personal reflection, Bridge To One asks a simple question: what future will we help create?\n\nThis is not a traditional game. It is a short seated experience designed to inspire reflection, conversation, and action around AI, cooperation, ecology, and human responsibility.\n\nYou will move through a guided narrative, encounter contrasting visions of the future, reflect on the people you care about, and make a personal pledge toward building a better world.\n\nThis matches the design doc\u2019s core structure: a personalized 12-minute Quest 3 XR journey contrasting war, bifurcation, and abundance, ending with reflection and a pledge.", "short_description": "A 12-minute XR journey through three possible futures shaped by AI, human choice, nature, and global cooperation."}]}, "developer_nam